  "description": "The Central City Library (library ID\u202flib\u2011001, code\u202fLB001) is located at 123\u202fMain\u202fSt, Metropolis, Country and can be reached via email at\u202finfo@centralcitylibrary.org. The library belongs to the organisation identified at\u202fhttps://ils.rero.ch/api/organisations/12345, and the record conforms to the data model published at\u202fhttps://ils.rero.ch/schemas/libraries/library-v0.0.1.json.  \n\nRegular opening hours are as follows: the library is open Monday through Thursday from\u202f09:00\u202fto\u202f18:00, and on Friday from\u202f09:00\u202fto\u202f17:00. On Saturday and Sunday the library remains closed; the standard schedule for those days would be\u202f08:00\u202fto\u202f17:00\u202fif it were open.  \n\nAn exception to the regular schedule is noted for Christmas Day: the library is closed on\u202f2026\u201112\u201125, with the closure period running from\u202f2026\u201112\u201125T00:00:00Z\u202fto\u202f2026\u201112\u201125T23:59:59Z."
